    AT COMPILE TIME" until 2026-10-13; #468 alone enforced only the upper end.)

    #466 shipped this as a COMMENT ONLY, on the rationale that _Static_assert is
    C11 while this tree is C99, and that an assert can only name terms that
    already exist -- so a new #define would add a name it does not mention and
    compile clean.  *** BOTH LEGS WERE REFUTED on #466's pass 2, independently by
    two seats -- ONE MEASURING (opus5, which BUILT ALL FOUR VARIANTS) and one
    REASONING (the kimi-k3:cloud substitute, "by reasoning rather than building"
    -- 29b450ce's own message).  This said "REFUTED BY MEASUREMENT ...
    independently by two seats" until 2026-10-13; the measurement was one seat's: ***
